<title>TURKEY: One dead at oil refinery blast in Turkey.</title>
<headline>One dead at oil refinery blast in Turkey.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>An explosion hit the Tupras oil refinery in central Turkey on Thursday, killing one worker, Anatolian news agency said.</p>
<p>It said the blast occurred in the early hours of the morning due to gas compression in an asphalt filling tank in the refinery in the town of Kirikkale.</p>
<p>The worker was on top of the tank taking measurements when the explosion happened, Anatolian said.</p>
